<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Grenfell cuts Bank of NY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Grenfell cuts Bank of NY.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Joel Silverstein said on Wednesday he was cutting his recommendation for the Bank of New York to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade was based on price appreciation and valuation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has met our objectives of both outperforming the market as well as achieving a price/earnings multiple expansion from its revised business mix,&quot; Silverstein wrote.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
